     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div>Just a word on Javascript/CSS / JQuery coding newbies. I have found the exercises in <a href=\"http://www.codecademy.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.codecademy.com/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792409928878000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3BDYn_Ed9gFLNrcVFEPCb9\">http://www.codecademy.com/</a> very easy to use and learn for learning. The course is free and there is afair amount of gamification/ fun badges thrown in .<br>\r\n\r\n<br></div>Best,<br><br>Ajay<br></div><div class=\"gmail_extra\"><br clear=\"all\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div>Sincerely,<br><br></div><div>Ajay Ohri<br><br></div><div>Author-<br></div>R for Business Analytics<br><a href=\"http://www.amazon.com/R-Business-Analytics-A-Ohri/dp/1461443423\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.amazon.com/R-Business-Analytics-A-Ohri/dp/1461443423&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792409928879000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0ozLyYokGqHFGXhdMMnNkU\">http://www.amazon.com/R-Business-Analytics-A-Ohri/dp/1461443423</a><br>\r\n\r\n</div></div>\r\n<br><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\">On Mon, Feb 11, 2013 at 10:59 AM,  <span dir=\"ltr\">&lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">shiny-...@googlegroups.com</a>&gt;</span> wrote:<br><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0 0 0 .8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\">\r\n\r\n<div style=\"font-family:arial;font-weight:bold;color:#222222;padding:0px\"> \r\n  <a name=\"m_-2186182038975029975_13cc7bb08b8c1fcb_digest_top\" style=\"color:#222222\" rel=\"nofollow\">Today&#39;s Topic Summary</a></div>\r\n<p>Group: <a style=\"color:15c;text-decoration:none\" href=\"http://groups.google.com/group/shiny-discuss/topics\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://groups.google.com/group/shiny-discuss/topics&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792409928879000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1OpbREHgL1dWilwE2LMj0O\">http://groups.google.com/group/shiny-discuss/topics</a></p>\r\n<ul style=\"margin-left:3px;padding-left:0px\">\r\n<li style=\"color:#555555\" type=\"square\"><a style=\"color:15c;text-decoration:none\" href=\"#m_-2186182038975029975_13cc7bb08b8c1fcb_group_thread_0\" rel=\"nofollow\">Select2 and DT_Bootstrap in one Shiny web app</a> [1 Update]</li>\r\n<li style=\"color:#555555\" type=\"square\"><a style=\"color:15c;text-decoration:none\" href=\"#m_-2186182038975029975_13cc7bb08b8c1fcb_group_thread_1\" rel=\"nofollow\">DataTable and Select2 in one Shiny web app</a> [1 Update]</li>\r\n<li style=\"color:#555555\" type=\"square\"><a style=\"color:15c;text-decoration:none\" href=\"#m_-2186182038975029975_13cc7bb08b8c1fcb_group_thread_2\" rel=\"nofollow\">onclick vs onchange</a> [1 Update]</li>\r\n<li style=\"color:#555555\" type=\"square\"><a style=\"color:15c;text-decoration:none\" href=\"#m_-2186182038975029975_13cc7bb08b8c1fcb_group_thread_3\" rel=\"nofollow\">Submit Button</a> [2 Updates]</li>\r\n<li style=\"color:#555555\" type=\"square\"><a style=\"color:15c;text-decoration:none\" href=\"#m_-2186182038975029975_13cc7bb08b8c1fcb_group_thread_4\" rel=\"nofollow\">Slider in html</a> [3 Updates]</li>\r\n\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n  \r\n  <a name=\"m_-2186182038975029975_13cc7bb08b8c1fcb_group_thread_0\" rel=\"nofollow\"></a>\r\n  <div style=\"background-color:#f5f5f5;font-family:arial;border-top:1px solid #e5e5e5;padding:4px 0 5px 32px\"> <a href=\"http://groups.google.com/group/shiny-discuss/t/9cfbd2cb2c9d7eb2\" style=\"color:15c;text-decoration:none\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://groups.google.com/group/shiny-discuss/t/9cfbd2cb2c9d7eb2&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792409928879000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2xeS5JblLpt64sHHXCcARL\">Select2 and DT_Bootstrap in one Shiny web app</a></div>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n  \r\n  <ul>\r\n    <div style=\"font-family:arial;padding:10px 20px 14px 20px;margin:0\"><span style=\"color:#222222;font-weight:bold\">David P &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">davidp...@gmail.com</a>&gt;</span> Feb 10 09:19PM -0800\r\n       <br><br>\r\n      This is a follow-up to at least three group discussions about extending <br>\r\nexisting Javascript controls within the Shiny framework, namely Select2 and <br>\r\nDataTable (Bootstrap). I wanted to write this to\r\n      <a style=\"color:15c;text-decoration:none\" href=\"http://groups.google.com/group/shiny-discuss/msg/2466f4dd7ae8ae89\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://groups.google.com/group/shiny-discuss/msg/2466f4dd7ae8ae89&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792409928879000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3CVheGWSuY59Rft3C6JFjg\">...more</a><br>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </ul>\r\n  \r\n\r\n  \r\n  <a name=\"m_-2186182038975029975_13cc7bb08b8c1fcb_group_thread_1\" rel=\"nofollow\"></a>\r\n  <div style=\"background-color:#f5f5f5;font-family:arial;border-top:1px solid #e5e5e5;padding:4px 0 5px 32px\"> <a href=\"http://groups.google.com/group/shiny-discuss/t/dc03c70e854deeb0\" style=\"color:15c;text-decoration:none\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://groups.google.com/group/shiny-discuss/t/dc03c70e854deeb0&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792409928879000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2YFVR5GSniRQP425JNPqs9\">DataTable and Select2 in one Shiny web app</a></div>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n  \r\n  <ul>\r\n    <div style=\"font-family:arial;padding:10px 20px 14px 20px;margin:0\"><span style=\"color:#222222;font-weight:bold\">David P &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">davidp...@gmail.com</a>&gt;</span> Feb 10 09:11PM -0800\r\n       <br><br>\r\n      This is a follow-up to at least three group discussions about extending <br>\r\nexisting Javascript controls within the Shiny framework, namely Select2 and <br>\r\nDataTable (Bootstrap). I wanted to write this to\r\n      <a style=\"color:15c;text-decoration:none\" href=\"http://groups.google.com/group/shiny-discuss/msg/1a3029174e0a271e\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://groups.google.com/group/shiny-discuss/msg/1a3029174e0a271e&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792409928879000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2pTCZrE5VOtC00f1vurxyJ\">...more</a><br>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </ul>\r\n  \r\n\r\n  \r\n  <a name=\"m_-2186182038975029975_13cc7bb08b8c1fcb_group_thread_2\" rel=\"nofollow\"></a>\r\n  <div style=\"background-color:#f5f5f5;font-family:arial;border-top:1px solid #e5e5e5;padding:4px 0 5px 32px\"> <a href=\"http://groups.google.com/group/shiny-discuss/t/9e856a3ad758e4bf\" style=\"color:15c;text-decoration:none\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://groups.google.com/group/shiny-discuss/t/9e856a3ad758e4bf&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792409928879000&amp;usg=AOvVaw26_G3DN0_htg70HKKUpgOf\">onclick vs onchange</a></div>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n  \r\n  <ul>\r\n    <div style=\"font-family:arial;padding:10px 20px 14px 20px;margin:0\"><span style=\"color:#222222;font-weight:bold\">Ramnath Vaidyanathan &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">ramnath...@gmail.com</a>&gt;</span> Feb 10 08:26PM -0800\r\n       <br><br>\r\n      Can you elaborate why this is required? I encountered the same problem <br>\r\nwhile using jQuery to directly reset a shiny action button. I had to click <br>\r\nthe action button twice to activate the required\r\n      <a style=\"color:15c;text-decoration:none\" href=\"http://groups.google.com/group/shiny-discuss/msg/d622fcdf983ccdff\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://groups.google.com/group/shiny-discuss/msg/d622fcdf983ccdff&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792409928879000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1EpzIyAb-Rli0fRH05kv_0\">...more</a><br>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </ul>\r\n  \r\n\r\n  \r\n  <a name=\"m_-2186182038975029975_13cc7bb08b8c1fcb_group_thread_3\" rel=\"nofollow\"></a>\r\n  <div style=\"background-color:#f5f5f5;font-family:arial;border-top:1px solid #e5e5e5;padding:4px 0 5px 32px\"> <a href=\"http://groups.google.com/group/shiny-discuss/t/1689ebf2fb4e7e99\" style=\"color:15c;text-decoration:none\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://groups.google.com/group/shiny-discuss/t/1689ebf2fb4e7e99&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792409928879000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1lykzL3czvj5kXuqv7tA-M\">Submit Button</a></div>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n  \r\n  <ul>\r\n    <div style=\"font-family:arial;padding:10px 20px 14px 20px;margin:0\"><span style=\"color:#222222;font-weight:bold\">David P &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">davidp...@gmail.com</a>&gt;</span> Feb 10 01:28PM -0800\r\n       <br><br>\r\n      Awesome Joe! Thank you so much for the guidance. I was able to get things <br>\r\nworking correctly. I am a complete Javascript/CSS newbie so it took me <br>\r\nawhile to get things working correctly, but I was\r\n      <a style=\"color:15c;text-decoration:none\" href=\"http://groups.google.com/group/shiny-discuss/msg/e37ec859cc690378\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://groups.google.com/group/shiny-discuss/msg/e37ec859cc690378&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792409928879000&amp;usg=AOvVaw37Jnm6HVazAGxh0Qem-yZ5\">...more</a><br>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </ul>\r\n  \r\n  <ul>\r\n    <div style=\"background-color:#f5f5f5;font-family:arial;padding:10px 20px 14px 20px;margin:0\"><span style=\"color:#222222;font-weight:bold\">Vincent &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">mostly.ha...@gmail.com</a>&gt;</span> Feb 10 01:44PM -0800\r\n       <br><br>\r\n      Sounds great David. Looking forward to your posts. Will you share your <br>\r\nfinal setup with Marcio for the &#39;shiny-extensions&#39; package? I am still <br>\r\ntrying to figure out how to get navbar setup as a\r\n      <a style=\"color:15c;text-decoration:none\" href=\"http://groups.google.com/group/shiny-discuss/msg/7f46f8b74f8372af\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://groups.google.com/group/shiny-discuss/msg/7f46f8b74f8372af&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792409928879000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3MQTRk1PCpAaoduFyQFf1k\">...more</a><br>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </ul>\r\n  \r\n\r\n  \r\n  <a name=\"m_-2186182038975029975_13cc7bb08b8c1fcb_group_thread_4\" rel=\"nofollow\"></a>\r\n  <div style=\"background-color:#f5f5f5;font-family:arial;border-top:1px solid #e5e5e5;padding:4px 0 5px 32px\"> <a href=\"http://groups.google.com/group/shiny-discuss/t/e578aca7acd0ac7d\" style=\"color:15c;text-decoration:none\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://groups.google.com/group/shiny-discuss/t/e578aca7acd0ac7d&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792409928879000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3AZxyFZzVWqq8c8Y1rrizs\">Slider in html</a></div>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n  \r\n  <ul>\r\n    <div style=\"font-family:arial;padding:10px 20px 14px 20px;margin:0\"><span style=\"color:#222222;font-weight:bold\">Dawg &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">dag.l...@katrisk.com</a>&gt;</span> Feb 10 12:17AM -0800\r\n       <br><br>\r\n      Hello -<br>\r\n <br>\r\ndoes anybody have an easy to use example for how to set up sliders in html <br>\r\n(I&#39;m not using ui.R)?<br>\r\n <br>\r\nThanks,<br>\r\nDawg<br>\r\n\r\n      <a style=\"color:15c;text-decoration:none\" href=\"http://groups.google.com/group/shiny-discuss/msg/91fbfa3a4865b49f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://groups.google.com/group/shiny-discuss/msg/91fbfa3a4865b49f&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792409928879000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1QTlPP4IuHh5xi_Nm4zdv7\">...more</a><br>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </ul>\r\n  \r\n  <ul>\r\n    <div style=\"background-color:#f5f5f5;font-family:arial;padding:10px 20px 14px 20px;margin:0\"><span style=\"color:#222222;font-weight:bold\">Ramnath Vaidyanathan &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">ramnath...@gmail.com</a>&gt;</span> Feb 10 03:08AM -0800\r\n       <br><br>\r\n      You can use cat(as.character(sliderInput(...))) to generate the HTML <br>\r\nrequired for a given slider configuration and paste it into your HTML UI. <br>\r\nYou can do this for any of the shiny functions.<br>\r\n\r\n      <a style=\"color:15c;text-decoration:none\" href=\"http://groups.google.com/group/shiny-discuss/msg/65655db5fd94a689\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://groups.google.com/group/shiny-discuss/msg/65655db5fd94a689&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792409928879000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2JoCFv_PydQ_pSOMKZ-wc5\">...more</a><br>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </ul>\r\n  \r\n  <ul>\r\n    <div style=\"font-family:arial;padding:10px 20px 14px 20px;margin:0\"><span style=\"color:#222222;font-weight:bold\">Dawg &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">dag.l...@katrisk.com</a>&gt;</span> Feb 10 03:18AM -0800\r\n       <br><br>\r\n      I didn&#39;t know that. Fantastic, problem solved. Thanks, Ramnath.<br>\r\n <br>\r\nOn Sunday, February 10, 2013 3:08:56 AM UTC-8, Ramnath Vaidyanathan wrote:<br>\r\n\r\n      <a style=\"color:15c;text-decoration:none\" href=\"http://groups.google.com/group/shiny-discuss/msg/f65ae6dc5b5f4be3\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://groups.google.com/group/shiny-discuss/msg/f65ae6dc5b5f4be3&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792409928879000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3VNDvUQ6TwuG530S1X_bpK\">...more</a><br>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </ul>\r\n  \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n  <div style=\"color:#555555;padding:27px 0 0 40px\">\r\n  <p>\r\n    You received this message because you are subscribed to the Google Group shiny-discuss.<br>\r\n    You can <a style=\"color:15c;text-decoration:none\" href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">post via email</a>.<br>\r\n    To unsubscribe from this group, <a style=\"color:15c;text-decoration:none\" href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">send</a> an empty message.<br>\r\n    For more options, <a style=\"color:15c;text-decoration:none\" href=\"http://groups.google.com/group/shiny-discuss/topics\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://groups.google.com/group/shiny-discuss/topics&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792409928879000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1OpbREHgL1dWilwE2LMj0O\">visit</a> this group.<span><font color=\"#888888\"><br>\r\n  </font></span></p><span><font color=\"#888888\">\r\n\r\n<p></p>\r\n\r\n-- <br>\r\nYou received this message because you are subscribed to the Google Groups &quot;Shiny - Web Framework for R&quot; group.<br>\r\nTo unsubscribe from this group and stop receiving emails from it, send an email to <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">shiny-discus...@googlegroups.com</a>.<br>\r\nFor more options, visit <a href=\"https://groups.google.com/groups/opt_out\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/groups/opt_out&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792409928879000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2WRDshFugArbSDIoTH20zO\">https://groups.google.com/groups/opt_out</a>.<br>\r\n <br>\r\n <br>\r\n</font></span></div></blockquote></div><br></div>\r\n"
